  "description": "<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"947\">De <strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"737\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Sony</span></span> PlayStation 4 Gran Turismo Edition</strong> is een <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"781\">speciale limited edition console</strong>, uitgebracht ter ere van Gran Turismo. Deze uitvoering beschikt over <strong data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"871\">1TB opslagruimte</strong> en onderscheidt zich door het exclusieve ontwerp met Gran Turismo-accenten.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1025\">De console verkeert in een <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"991\">prima staat</strong> en is volledig getest op werking.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1057\">🎮 Belangrijkste kenmerken</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1110\">🕹️ PlayStation 4 <strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1110\">Gran Turismo Limited Edition</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1130\">💾 <strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1130\">1TB opslag</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1169\">🎨 Uniek GT-design (speciale editie)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1206\">🏎️ Gelanceerd i.c.m. Gran Turismo</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1257\">🌐 Geschikt voor online gaming en streaming apps</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1287\">🔍 Staat van het product</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1377\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1303\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1303\">Prima staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1346\">Normale lichte gebruikssporen mogelijk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1377\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1377\">Technisch volledig in orde</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1394\">📦 Levering</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1439\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1439\">PlayStation 4 Gran Turismo Edition – 1TB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1454\">Bekabeling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1519\">en GT PS4 controller</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1645\">Een <strong data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1554\">bijzondere PS4-uitvoering</strong> die je minder vaak tegenkomt, ideaal voor <strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1618\">Gran Turismo-fans</strong> of als <strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1644\">verzamelobject</strong>.</p>",
